<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n92015" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πῶυ</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εος</span>, τό, pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πώεα, τά</span>, 
			Ep.
		 Noun, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>flock</i>, in <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> of sheep, in phrases, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰῶν μέγα πῶυ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					3.198
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				11.696
			</span></i>,al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰῶν πώεα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					11.402
				</span></i>
			; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βοῶν ἀγέλαι</span>, <i><span class="en">
				12.129
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				11.678
			</span></i>, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πώεσι μήλων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					4.413
				</span></i>
			, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πώεα</span> abs., <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Op.</u>
				516
			</span></i>; apptly. of goats, <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>H.</u>
				2.500
			</span></i>; later 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πώεα παίδων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nonn.
					<u>D.</u>
					3.302
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁλίτροφα π. λίμνης</span>, of
			fish, ib.<i><span class="en">
				41.33
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>H.</u>
				1.66
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				2.547
			</span></i>.</div>
